WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:05.057
Let us build product launch assets as a coherent visual system.

2
00:00:05.057 --> 00:00:11.583
Start with composition and reusable components, then move into motion, materials, and controlled variation.

3
00:00:11.983 --> 00:00:16.669
Build a flexible campaign layout in Figma and plan the hero shot in Higgsfield.

4
00:00:16.669 --> 00:00:23.075
In Cinema 4D, refine the product silhouette, material response, and lighting before the sequence is edited.

5
00:00:23.475 --> 00:00:26.604
Use After Effects to control the reveal and typography.

6
00:00:26.604 --> 00:00:34.058
Adapt the campaign into different formats in Canva, then review the final timing and color in Resolve at the actual delivery size.

7
00:00:34.458 --> 00:00:36.887
Adapt the work into multi-format campaign.

8
00:00:36.887 --> 00:00:43.942
Compare formats side by side, preview the movement, and review the final experience at the size people will actually see.
